{"step_index":194,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:27:49Z","thinking":"The user's request targets companies with business numbers, implying a need to filter the dataset. Determining the scope, the total companies with business numbers needs to be verified; currently, 1,892 are confirmed from a total of 2,313 data rows (2,314 including the header). The count must include any newly validated business registrations due to previous processing.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Inspect blank columns across all rows in CSV","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nconst origCsvPath = 'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\오늘\\\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑.csv';\nconst buffer = fs.readFileSync(origCsvPath);\nconst text = new TextDecoder('utf-8').decode(buffer);\n\nfunction parseCSV(content) {\n    const rows = [];\n    let currentRow = [];\n    let currentCell = '';\n    let inQuotes = false;\n    for (let i = 0; i < content.length; i++) {\n        const char = content[i];\n        const nextChar = content[i + 1];\n        if (char === '\"') {\n            if (inQuotes && nextChar === '\"') {\n                currentCell += '\"';\n                i++;\n            } else {\n                inQuotes = !inQuotes;\n            }\n        } else if (char === ',' && !inQuotes) {\n            currentRow.push(currentCell.trim());\n            currentCell = '';\n        } else if ((char === '\\r' || char === '\\n') && !inQuotes) {\n            if (char === '\\r' && nextChar === '\\n') i++;\n            currentRow.push(currentCell.trim());\n            if (currentRow.some(c => c.length > 0)) rows.push(currentRow);\n            currentRow = [];\n            currentCell = '';\n        } else {\n            currentCell += char;\n        }\n    }\n    if (currentCell.length > 0 || currentRow.length > 0) {\n        currentRow.push(currentCell.trim());\n        if (currentRow.some(c => c.length > 0)) rows.push(currentRow);\n    }\n    return rows;\n}\n\nconst rows = parseCSV(text);\nconst header = rows[0];\nconsole.log('Header:', header);\n\nconst colCounts = {};\nconst blankCountsWithBizNo = {};\nconst totalWithBizNo = [];\nconst bizIdx = header.indexOf('사업자번호');\n\nheader.forEach((h, idx) => {\n    blankCountsWithBizNo[h] = 0;\n});\n\nlet withBiz = 0;\nlet withoutBiz = 0;\n\nfor (let i = 1; i < rows.length; i++) {\n    const r = rows[i];\n    const b = (r[bizIdx] || '').replace(/[\"'\\s-]/g, '');\n    if (b.length >= 10) {\n        withBiz++;\n        header.forEach((h, idx) => {\n            const val = (r[idx] || '').trim();\n            if (!val || val === '-' || val === '') {\n                blankCountsWithBizNo[h]++;\n            }\n        });\n    } else {\n        withoutBiz++;\n    }\n}\n\nconsole.log(`Total rows: ${rows.length - 1}`);\nconsole.log(`With BizNo: ${withBiz}`);\nconsole.log(`Without BizNo: ${withoutBiz}`);\nconsole.log('\\nBlank counts among rows WITH BizNo:');\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(blankCountsWithBizNo, null, 2));\n\n// Sample first 5 rows with BizNo to see what is blank\nconsole.log('\\nSample rows with BizNo (first 3):');\nfor (let i = 1; i < Math.min(4, rows.length); i++) {\n    console.log(`Row ${i+1}:`, header.map((h, idx) => `${h}: \"${rows[i][idx] || ''}\"`).join(' | '));\n}\n","Description":"Analyze blank cells in rows with business numbers","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\inspect_blanks.js","toolAction":"Analyze blank cells","toolSummary":"Analyze blank cells"}}]}
